    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Roland",
            "Huh? Can't run anymore?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "There's nowhere else to run. The Corrupted are swarming from behind. You can't take them out alone.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "He grabs the boy's neck to force him to look back."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Even though the Corrupted projections have been destroyed, the young Construct still continues to look toward the other end of the street in anguish and rage."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "It appears that, while standing there, he must have a seen a dire situation with many Corrupted blocking their way out."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "Let... me... go...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "You're too weak now. It wouldn't be wise to resist.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "I... don't know... what... you're... talking about...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The pressure from his neck suddenly increases. His consciousness and voice slowly fade."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "Rgh... Argh...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Hurts, doesn't it?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Whether it be humans or Constructs... Life without \"ascension\" is so fragile.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "Let... Let me go...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 28,
        "ActionId": 28,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Oh? Why do you still insist on resisting? Let me see the answer in your M.I.N.D.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 29,
        "ActionId": 29,
        "Type": 501,
        "Params": [
            "Assets/Product/Effect/Prefab/FxUi/FxUiStoryNew/FxUiStoryGanRanNew.prefab",
            "",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 30,
        "ActionId": 30,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "A red current flows through Roland's arm and the hand that is grabbing the boy's neck, and surges into his entire body in an instant."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 31,
        "ActionId": 31,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "As the corruption continues to rise, Roland is able to easily uncover the data within the boy's M.I.N.D."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 32,
        "ActionId": 32,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "You—",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 33,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Relax. If you're not careful, I'll tear your M.I.N.D. to pieces.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "No... Don't...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "...I see. You were sold by your mother... Ah, yet another orphan.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "...What?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "I've seen many others like you—all abandoned. They will be \"ascended,\" then saved from their sea of suffering.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "I... don't need saving!",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "It seems that you've been misguided by what you believe is correct.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "You—!",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Even though Roland's words and corruption have filled the boy with misery, the young Construct continues to struggle in resistance."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "You heard that she came here with other scavengers. Is that not why you applied to conduct a mission here?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Are you using this as a way to find your family? But your memories of her were from so long ago. Even if you see her now, you might not even recognize her.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "...Mind your own... business...",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Hearing the boy's response, Roland shows an unsurprising expression of contempt, then throws the boy into the collapsed ruins. Smiling, he slowly walks toward him."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "What a pity. After becoming a Construct, your predecessor who took care of you was rebooted after being seriously injured. She not only lost her memory data, but was also transferred out of here.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "You are powerless in protecting her. That's why you lost. Without her, the other members will only belittle you. Isn't that right?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The young Construct clenches his teeth tightly and struggles as the corruption continues to take hold."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "You have nothing. However, it is because you have nothing, that I can give you everything—on behalf of the Ascendants.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 50,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Why protect a group of people who beat you down? Why bother transporting supplies to people who don't respect you at all?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 51,
        "ActionId": 51,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Because you are too weak. If you have the power of an Ascendant, no one will dare to look down on you again. Your beloved predecessor wouldn't have forgotten everything from being injured so badly.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 52,
        "ActionId": 52,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "The power of... an Ascendant?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 53,
        "ActionId": 53,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Yes. Become an Ascendant—your hatred is your greatest gift.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 54,
        "ActionId": 54,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "With your power as an Ascendant, you can wave the blade of revenge against the people you hate.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 55,
        "ActionId": 55,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "Can I... really?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 56,
        "ActionId": 56,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Of course.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 57,
        "ActionId": 57,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "...How will you do that?",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 58,
        "ActionId": 58,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Roland",
            "Just make it there alive.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 59,
        "ActionId": 59,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Roland grasps the young Construct's hand and gives him coordinates."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 60,
        "ActionId": 60,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Young Construct",
            "Heh... With this amount of corruption... I'm afraid...",
            2
        ]
    },
